Recording-level embedding IDs name the condition: `<recording_id>_cond-<condition>`, from `load_embedding_derivatives` (and `embedding_observation_id`) when the artifact metadata has a `condition`, and from `load_combined_embedding_table` when the table has a `condition` column. A recording-level row holds one condition of a recording, so the eyes-open and eyes-closed rows of one recording had the same ID, and a container loaded with several conditions had repeated IDs. Epoch IDs are unchanged (`<recording_id>_epoch-<i>`, as the BIDS loader numbers epochs).
